<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>About | <%= siteName %></title>
    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@tailwindcss/browser@4"></script>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/redesign.css">
</head>
<style>
* {
    box-sizing: border-box;
}
body {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
    color: #243b5a;
    background:radial-gradient(circle at 10% 20%, rgba(52, 125, 210, 0.20), transparent 25%), radial-gradient(circle at 90% 80%,  rgba(30, 90, 170, 0.18),transparent 25%),
    linear-gradient(135deg, #dcecff, #b8d3ef);
    min-height: 100vh;
}
.about-container {
    width: 90%;
    max-width: 1050px;
    margin: 55px auto 70px;
    padding: 42px;
    background: #ffffff;
    border-radius: 18px;
    border: 1px solid #d5e3f2;
    box-shadow: 0 10px 28px rgba(31, 78, 121, 0.15);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 50px;
}
.about-content {
    flex: 1;
}
.about-content h1 {
    margin: 0 0 20px;
    font-size: 32px;
    color: #174a82;
}
.about-content p {
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: #526b86;
    margin-bottom: 15px;
}
.about-box {
    margin-top: 25px;
    padding: 18px 20px;
    background: #f1f7fd;
    border-left: 4px solid #2878d7;
    border-radius: 8px;
}
.about-box h3 {
    margin: 0 0 8px;
    color: #174a82;
}
.about-box p {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 14px;
}
.about-image {
    width: 330px;
    text-align: center;
}
.about-image img {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 300px;
    max-height: 390px;
    object-fit: contain;
    border-radius: 12px;
    box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(31, 78, 121, 0.18);
}
@media (max-width: 800px) {
    .about-container {
        flex-direction: column;
        width: 92%;
        padding: 30px 25px;
        gap: 30px;
    }
    .about-image {
        width: 100%;
    }
}
</style>
<body>
    <%- include('includes/nav.ejs') %>
    <div class="about-container">
        <div class="about-content">
           <h1>A Little About Book Worm</h1>
            <p>
                Book Worm is an online bookstore created for readers
                who love exploring and discovering new books.
            </p>
            <p>
                Our store brings books from different categories
                together in one simple and easy-to-use place.
            </p>
            <p>
                Whether you enjoy stories, general reading or
                learning something new, Book Worm helps you find
                books that match your interests.
            </p>
            <div class="about-box">
                <h3>What We Offer</h3>
                <p>
                    Easy book browsing &nbsp; | &nbsp;
                    Different categories &nbsp; | &nbsp;
                    Simple and user-friendly experience
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="about-image">
            <img src="/uploads/bookkk.jpg" alt="Book">
        </div>
    </div>
    <%- include('includes/footer.ejs') %>
</body>
</html>